Purpose of the fork
-------------------
The upstream harness drives a SteVe CSMS. This copy keeps the scenario
specifications and the OCPP-J assertion engine and replaces the CSMS-facing
driver, so the same certification scenarios can be run against a different
CSMS. Since shiv3/ocpp-cp-simulator#271 upstream has ceded the runner layer
to this repository: the files below are FORKED — maintained here, no longer
tracking upstream — rather than patched copies of an upstream original.

